qrb-video-v4l2-lib (0.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add a GStreamer backend selectable through VideoCodec::Target
  * Report codec failures through the new Notifier::onError callback
  * Select backends at build time with QRB_VIDEO_ENABLE_V4L2/_GST
  * Raise the libqrb-video-v4l2-1 shlibs minimum to 0.2.0: Notifier gained a vtable slot,
    so consumers must be rebuilt against the 0.2.0 headers
  * Default the shipped build to the GStreamer backend, with V4L2 still built and
    reachable through the nodes' backend parameter

 -- Jean Xiao <jianxiao@qti.qualcomm.com>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

qrb-video-v4l2-lib (0.1.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: Ensure proper handling of video frame rates in MP4 container
  * Update documentation for framerate processing
  * Minor bug fixes and performance improvements

 -- Jean Xiao <jianxiao@qti.qualcomm.com>  Tue, 29 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000

qrb-video-v4l2-lib (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of QRB Video V4L2 Library
  * Hardware-accelerated video encoding and decoding support
  * V4L2 interface for Qualcomm Robotics platforms

